PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785257279
OL,3,CPlanning permission for Spurs training
OL,4,Cground on London park quashed by judge
OL,6,FA council's decision to allow
OL,7,FTottenham Hotspur to build a new
OL,8,Ftraining facility on a London park has
OL,9,Fbeen quashed by a judge at the High
OL,10,FCourt.
OL,12,FEnfield Council had decided to grant
OL,13,Fplanning permission for a new women
OL,14,Fand girls' football academy on 16
OL,15,Facres of land in Whitewebbs Park,
OL,16,Fnorth London.
OL,18,FCampaign group Guardians of Whitewebbs
OL,19,Ftold a hearing in June, that this
OL,20,Fdecision was unlawful.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785257279
OL,3,CPlanning permission for Spurs training
OL,4,Cground on London park quashed by judge
OL,6,FThe group's lawyers told the hearing
OL,7,Fin London that the council breached
OL,8,Fthe rules when making its decision, as
OL,9,Fcouncillors were not provided with all
OL,10,Frelevant information regarding the
OL,11,Fdevelopment's environmental impact.
OL,13,FThey also claimed there was a "real
OL,14,Fpossibility of bias" in the decision
OL,15,Fas Spurs had "unparalleled access" to
OL,16,Fsenior council figures at the time of
OL,17,Fthe application.
OL,19,FEnfield Council withdrew its defence
OL,20,Fto the claim last month.
OL,26,@uD@_OUvD@TO]wD@NOUwD@bO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785257279
OL,3,CPlanning permission for Spurs training
OL,4,Cground on London park quashed by judge
OL,6,FBut Spurs continued to oppose the
OL,7,Fchallenge, claiming it should be
OL,8,Fdismissed as the result "would
OL,9,Finevitably have been the same" had the
OL,10,Finformation been provided.
OL,12,FIt also said that allegations of bias
OL,13,Fwere "completely overblown".
OL,15,FIn a ruling on Monday, Sir Tim Kerr,
OL,16,Fsitting as a High Court judge, quashed
OL,17,Fthe decision to approve the plans,
OL,18,Ffinding the result "could well have
OL,19,Fbeen different" had all the relevant
OL,20,Finformation about the scheme been
OL,21,Favailable.
OL,26,@pD@YOUqD@^O]uD@FOUuD@[O]zD@TOU{D@OO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785257279
OL,3,CPlanning permission for Spurs training
OL,4,Cground on London park quashed by judge
OL,6,FHe dismissed claims concerning
OL,7,Fpotential bias, describing the group's
OL,8,Farguments as "weak" and stating that
OL,9,F"cordial relations" between the
OL,10,Fcouncil and the club were "normal
OL,11,Fgiven the overlapping functions and
OL,12,Finterests".
OL,14,FThe club agreed a 25 year lease for
OL,15,Fthe site in 2023 ` a decision that was
OL,16,Funsuccessfully challenged at the High
OL,17,FCourt in 2024 and the council resolved
OL,18,Fto approve the planning application in
OL,19,FFebruary last year.
OL,26,@pD@NOUpD@SO]qD@AOUqD@SO]rD@[OUtD@JO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785257279
OL,3,CPlanning permission for Spurs training
OL,4,Cground on London park quashed by judge
OL,6,FThe plans would have seen the
OL,7,Fconstruction of 10 football pitches
OL,8,Fand other work on the park, which is
OL,9,Fnear the club's men's training
OL,10,Ffacilities.
OL,12,FJenny Wigley KC, for Guardians of
OL,13,FWhitewebbs, said in written
OL,14,Fsubmissions that in November 2024,
OL,15,Fecologist Giles Sutton had carried out
OL,16,Fa report into the environmental
OL,17,Fbenefits of the plans.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785257279
OL,3,CPlanning permission for Spurs training
OL,4,Cground on London park quashed by judge
OL,6,FMr Sutton told the council that while
OL,7,Fhe did not oppose the scheme "as
OL,8,Fsuch", it was "counter-intuitive" to
OL,9,Faccept the club's claims that the site
OL,10,Fwould benefit the local environment as
OL,11,Faround 40% of the park would be lost.
OL,13,FBut Ms Wigley said that council
OL,14,Fofficers claimed in a planning report
OL,15,Fthat there was "no objection to the
OL,16,Fproposed development", despite Mr
OL,17,FSutton telling the authority that this
OL,18,Fdid not reflect his advice.
OL,26,@oD@^OUpD@EO]pD@OOUpD@aO]wD@POUxD@UO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785257279
OL,3,CPlanning permission for Spurs training
OL,4,Cground on London park quashed by judge
OL,6,FThe barrister continued that Mr
OL,7,FSutton's report "clearly informed the
OL,8,Fplanning officers' views" on the
OL,9,Fenvironmental impact of the scheme,
OL,10,Fand should have been presented as a
OL,11,F"background document", meaning members
OL,12,Fof the public could have inspected it.
OL,14,FShe said the law "does not permit this
OL,15,Fkind of salami slicing, where a
OL,16,Fplanning officer can disclose parts of
OL,17,Fa report they agree with but can avoid
OL,18,Fpublic scrutiny of the parts of the
OL,19,Freport they do not agree with".
OL,26,@oD@QOUpD@YO]sD@AOUsD@UO]vD@ROU{D@^O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785257279
OL,3,CPlanning permission for Spurs training
OL,4,Cground on London park quashed by judge
OL,6,FJames Maurici KC, for Spurs, said Mr
OL,7,FSutton's views were "no more than an
OL,8,Fassertion". He said the Guardians of
OL,9,FWhitewebbs had "failed to provide any
OL,10,Fevidence" that it had been prejudiced
OL,11,Fby the council's failure to provide
OL,12,Fthe document. He continued:
OL,14,F"It is highly likely, indeed
OL,15,Finevitable, given the absence of any
OL,16,Fevidence of prejudice, that the
OL,17,Foutcome for the claimant would not
OL,18,Fhave been substantially different if
OL,19,Fthe conduct complained of had not
OL,20,Foccurred."
OL,26,@oD@UOUpD@JO]qD@POUrD@IO]vD@AOU|D@JO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785257279
OL,3,CPlanning permission for Spurs training
OL,4,Cground on London park quashed by judge
OL,6,FBut Sir Tim said the council's non-
OL,7,Fcompliance with rules was "serious"
OL,8,Fand that councillors were "materially
OL,9,Fmisled" by the exclusion of Mr
OL,10,FSutton's report.
OL,12,FThe judge also said the club was
OL,13,F"wrong to submit" that "there is
OL,14,Fnothing that (Guardians of Whitewebbs)
OL,15,Fcould or would have usefully said if
OL,16,FMr Sutton's ecological report had been
OL,17,Fdisclosed".
OL,26,@oD@[OUoD@cO]pD@[OUqD@GO]uD@AOUuD@QO]uD@
OL,26,AXOUyD@JO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785257279
OL,3,CPlanning permission for Spurs training
OL,4,Cground on London park quashed by judge
OL,6,F"It was important for the public to
OL,7,Fhave access to (Mr Sutton's report)
OL,8,Fbefore the meeting precisely because
OL,9,Fits content was not correctly
OL,10,Frepresented in the officers' report."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@eO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G10/10
